    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Ericsson LM Telephone Co, also known as ERICSSON (LM) TEL-SP ADR, is a for-profit public company headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden, trading under the ticker ERIC. Its website describes the company as powering the networks that connect billions, with work spanning 5G, AI-driven automation, and enterprise connectivity that unites 5G, AI, and cloud.\n\nThe site discusses the company's perspective on 6G as an intelligent fabric connecting people and machines through mobile, cloud, and AI systems. It also covers network slicing, orchestration, and AI-driven tools for connectivity, and highlights Open RAN through AT&T's Open Radio Access Network transformation, which the site says creates an open, disaggregated, and programmable network. The company presents trusted AI for networks as a central theme, stating that trust will determine how far AI can go in telecom.\n\nNo litigation, no MCP servers, and no tracked products are listed for the company. It is registered with the US SEC under CIK 0000717826.",
